WHY THIS DEFAULT
  The project DMSP sets CC-BY-4.0 as the default for public datasets, with
  CC0-1.0 where unrestricted reuse is preferred and permitted. Every dataset also
  carries its own `license` field, which is what actually governs it -- this file
  is the repository-level default.

ON RELEASE
  Data is released no later than publication of the paper it supports. Until then
  a dataset's `access_status` is `internal` or `staged`, and this repository is
  private. Changing the file does not change the field; change the field.

FILL IN THE COPYRIGHT LINE ABOVE before your first commit.
